        <briefdescription>
<para>Creates an SDL window with an OpenGL context. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Creates the SDL window and OpenGL context.</para>
<para>This method sets OpenGL attributes (version 4.6 Core Profile), creates the window, initializes GLAD (OpenGL function loader), and configures the viewport.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>title</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Window title. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>width</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Window width in pixels. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>height</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Window height in pixels. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>fullscreen</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Whether to start in fullscreen mode. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>true if the window and context were created successfully, false otherwise.</para>
</simplesect>
It sets OpenGL attributes (currently version 4.6 Core Profile), then creates the SDL window with the OpenGL flag, OpenGL context, initializes GLAD, sets swap interval (vsync) and log driver information then sets the viewport to match the window size.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>title</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Window title. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>width</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Window width in pixels. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>height</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Window height in pixels. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>fullscreen</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Whether to start in fullscreen mode. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>true if all steps succeeded, false otherwise. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
