    <briefdescription>
<para>Wrapper for an SDL3 window with OpenGL context. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class manages the creation, destruction, and swapping of an SDL window with an OpenGL context. It abstracts the platform-specific window handling and provides a clean interface for the engine.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="note"><para>The OpenGL context is created with version 4.6 Core Profile. </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classEngine" kindref="compound">Engine</ref>, <ref refid="classGraphicsContext" kindref="compound">GraphicsContext</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
